# Keep only images and diagram sources in this folder.
# draw.io leaves backup/temporary files (*.bkp, *.dtmp) when saving: they stay out of Git.

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except subfolders and this file
!*/
!.gitignore

# ...and except images, PDFs and draw.io sources
!*.png
!*.jpg
!*.jpeg
!*.gif
!*.svg
!*.pdf
!*.drawio
